                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Trebuchet MS'>Key Insights Delivered:</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Trebuchet MS' fontsize='9'>• Booking volume and revenue trends</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Trebuchet MS' fontsize='9'>• Ride completion performance and cancellation drivers</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Trebuchet MS' fontsize='9'>• Customer segmentation and behavior patterns</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Trebuchet MS' fontsize='9'>• Payment method distribution</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Trebuchet MS' fontsize='9'>• Demand variation across time periods</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Trebuchet MS' fontsize='9'>• High-activity pickup and route analysis</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Trebuchet MS'>Design &amp; Development:</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Trebuchet MS' fontsize='9'>All visual design elements and dashboard components have been created entirely within Tableau, without the use of any external tools.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Trebuchet MS'>Purpose:</run>
